abstract: >-
  Strong Inference is an open research-software suite for evidence-governed
  AI-assisted technical work, including orchestration, formal reasoning,
  research discovery, method synthesis, engineering verification, evaluation,
  process assurance, independent review, decision preflight, and adaptive
  complementary assistance. Strong Inference Systems is a working pre-product
  company identity and is not represented by this metadata as a legally cleared
  corporate or trademark name.
